[00:00.000] 作词 : Dani Giguere
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Dani Giguere
[00:41.105]Lilacs embracing you, heartsick and weak
[00:48.911]I lose myself in your irises
[00:53.475]As we’re fading into sleep
[00:57.935]And I wonder if you dream of me
[01:02.464]Like I’ll always do of you
[01:07.326]Will you hold my pain in your heart
[01:10.902]Or will it blight you too
[01:16.558]All I want in this life is you, unbridled and pure
[01:25.953]You’re the violets, the droughts, the thunderclouds, the birds
[01:36.760]I write your name
[01:39.669]In the fog of your window
[01:46.625]I want to be closer to you
[01:53.886]Porcelain widow, the silence
[01:59.315]Bookending your absence
[02:03.838]Is deafening
[02:07.250]I’ll never know myself again
[02:14.523]Trying to drown the thoughts in my head
[02:23.876]Begging love to stay one more night
[02:31.453]Cut the stem, dim the light
[02:35.309]I feel your arms wrapped around me
[02:41.454]Lulling me into slumber, painless and blissful
[03:10.612]Soma, darling, you’re the only one for me
[03:19.667]Lotus fruits and lucid dreams
[03:29.194]If I can’t love you
[03:32.055]In the stars above us then
[03:38.665]I’ll confine myself to sleep
